# Animated 3D Parallax — a 300pt card that tilts in 3D toward the finger (rotateX/Y from
# the touch point) while its logo follows on a looser spring for a parallax lag.
# What this test covers: a tap on each corner and the centre (onBegin sets the
# touch, release springs back to centre); slow pans along both diagonals and
# edges; a pan that leaves the card (interpolate extrapolates past 18deg since
# the gesture is not cancelled outside); quick back-and-forth pans so the two
# springs are retargeted mid-flight; settling to rest (spring tails near 0deg).
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/animated-3d-parallax"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
wait 1000
# Corners and centre taps.
press 70 305
wait 700
press 333 305
wait 700
press 70 570
wait 700
press 333 570
wait 700
press 201 437
wait 700
# Diagonals and edges.
gesture pan 70 305 260 260 1200
wait 1200
gesture pan 333 305 -260 260 1200
wait 1200
gesture pan 70 300 260 0 900
wait 1000
gesture pan 70 580 260 0 900
wait 1000
gesture pan 60 300 0 280 900
wait 1000
# Leave the card while still touching.
gesture pan 201 437 170 300 900
wait 1200
gesture pan 201 437 -170 -280 900
wait 1200
# Fast retargeting.
gesture pan 100 437 200 0 150
wait 60
gesture pan 300 437 -200 0 150
wait 60
gesture pan 201 330 0 200 150
wait 60
press 333 570 --count 4
wait 2500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
